flowchart TD
  S[Root restart] --> H[Read immutable hierarchy]
  H --> E[Replay hierarchy events and cursors]
  E --> T[Observe tmux session/windows/panes]
  T --> V{Team has durable launch footprint?}
  V -- no --> N[Eligible for launch under contract/budget]
  V -- yes --> F{Verified team receipt?}
  F -- yes --> C[Mark terminal from receipt]
  F -- no --> P{Live team-lead process/pane observed?}
  P -- yes --> I[Import messages and continue]
  P -- no --> L[Record lost/intervention-required]
  N --> D[Create window and canonical team-lead run]
  D --> I
